  "description": "Reid Transit WSD | Women's commuter bike\nLightweight, comfortable and built for everyday journeys – the ideal women's commuter bike for travelling to work or school, getting around town and running errands.\nThe Reid Bikes Transit WSD bike is designed to make everyday cycling comfortable, practical and enjoyable. Featuring a women's-specific frame geometry and lightweight alloy construction, it offers a responsive, easy-to-handle ride for commuting, urban journeys and leisurely rides along local cycle paths.\nIts hydroformed alloy frame is paired with 700c wheels and wide 42mm Kenda tyres, providing a stable, comfortable ride across roads, cycle paths and city streets. Internally routed cables give the bike a clean, streamlined appearance while helping protect them from dirt and everyday wear.\nA 14-speed drivetrain combines a double front chainset with a 7-speed rear freewheel, giving you a versatile range of gears for flat roads, everyday commutes and moderate hills. Alloy V-brakes provide reliable stopping power, while double-wall alloy rims offer durability for regular use.\nDesigned with practicality in mind, the Reid Bikes Transit WSD bike includes rack and mudguard mounts, making it easy to customise for your daily routine. Add a rear rack and panniers to carry work essentials or shopping, or fit mudguards for extra protection in wet weather. A chainstay-mounted kickstand also makes parking more convenient when stopping during your journey.\nAvailable in three frame sizes, the Reid Transit WSD combines comfort, versatility and everyday practicality in a lightweight package. Whether you're commuting to work, cycling to school or simply choosing a more active way to get around, it's built to make everyday journeys easier.\nThe Reid Bikes Transit WSD is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters, looking for a lightweight and comfortable bike for travelling to work or school\n\nCity and urban riding, with responsive handling and stable 700c wheels for navigating roads and cycle paths\n\nRiders tackling varied routes, with a 14-speed drivetrain offering practical gearing for everyday journeys and moderate hills\n\nComfort-focused cyclists, with women's-specific frame geometry and wide 42mm Kenda tyres for a comfortable, stable ride\n\nPractical everyday transport, with rack and mudguard mounts for adding panniers, luggage and weather protection\n\nReliable everyday cycling, with alloy V-brakes for dependable stopping power and double-wall alloy rims for durability\n\nRiders who value convenience, with a chainstay-mounted kickstand for easier parking when running errands or carrying bags\n\nWomen looking for the right fit, with three frame sizes to help find a comfortable riding position\n\nAnyone seeking an alternative to driving, offering a practical way to commute, run errands and enjoy more time on two wheels",
